NOTICE — CTP-EOS XFCE Desktop (downstream model)

This repository is a downstream of upstream XFCE.

- upstream/ holds the XFCE source baseline. Upstream XFCE components
  remain under their own respective licenses; no root license file is
  claimed for them here.
- branding/ holds CTP-EOS identity and visual design.
- config/ holds CTP-EOS default user experience settings.
- patches/ holds intentional CTP-EOS source-level modifications.
- docs/ holds project architecture and contributor documentation.

CTP-EOS additions are maintained according to their project licensing
terms. Upstream sources are kept separate from CTP-EOS customizations
so upstream compatibility is preserved.
